# REBASH Academy Interview Page System

## Canonical interview mandate (mandatory)

Follow `.cursor/prompts/tutorials/create_interview_questions.md` and `.cursor/rules/00-foundation/09-content-quality-standard.mdc`.

- Topic-specific questions only (no generic Cloud boilerplate)
- Mix: concept · scenario · troubleshooting · trade-offs
- Model answers explain *why* they are strong; include follow-ups on standalone guides
- In-tutorial: 5–8 questions + 2–3 `!!! tip` sample answers

Prefer Codex until the user changes agents.

## Purpose

This rule defines how interview preparation pages should be generated.

Interview pages prepare learners for real engineering interviews.

Every interview page should simulate the experience of interviewing with a modern engineering organisation.

