# Success Criteria

Every REBASH Academy interview page should feel like a professional mock interview conducted by experienced engineering leaders.

Learners should improve their technical knowledge, communication skills, problem-solving ability and production engineering mindset while understanding exactly how interviewers evaluate candidates.

The learner should finish thinking:

"I know how to think, communicate and solve problems like the engineer this role requires."